{
  "name": "Ragfeed: Watch a web page and alert on change",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{ "field": "days", "triggerAtHour": 8 }]
        }
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b01",
      "name": "Check daily",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b02",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Data_Protection_Regulation",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b03",
      "name": "URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.ragfeed.de/v2/scrape",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": \"{{ $json.url }}\",\n  \"formats\": [\n    \"markdown\",\n    { \"type\": \"changeTracking\", \"modes\": [\"git-diff\"] }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b04",
      "name": "Ragfeed: check page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "ragfeed-header",
          "name": "Ragfeed (Header)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b05",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.changeTracking.changeStatus }}",
              "rightValue": "changed",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b06",
      "name": "Changed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b07",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=The page {{ $('URL').item.json.url }} changed.\n\n{{ $json.data.changeTracking.diff }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b08",
      "name": "Build message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [880, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b09",
      "name": "Notify here (Slack/email/webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Watch a page, alert only on change\n\nThe schedule fetches the page and lets Ragfeed compare it against the last time. The previous state is kept **on Ragfeed's side**, not in n8n, so this runs in any installation.\n\n`data.changeTracking.changeStatus` is `new` (first run), `same` (unchanged) or `changed`. Only `changed` continues; `data.changeTracking.diff` holds the changed lines.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Credential **Header Auth**: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer ` + your Ragfeed key (`sk-…`).\n2. Put the page to watch in **URL** (e.g. a law or authority page).\n3. Replace **Notify here** with your channel: Slack, email, Telegram or a webhook.\n\nCost: 1 credit per check, no AI format needed. Tip: use `tag` to keep separate histories when you watch the same URL for different reasons.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4a20-9b02-1f2e3d4c5b10",
      "name": "Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 180]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Check daily": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "URL", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "URL": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Ragfeed: check page", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Ragfeed: check page": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Changed?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Changed?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Build message", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Build message": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Notify here (Slack/email/webhook)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
